# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Decision wanted: exact GPR on a global Coulomb-matrix representation has no registry method; GPR on SOAP without sparsification could be read as GAP-family, but the paper does not say so. Until decided, the runs (1,000 training and 2,000 test samples per data set; 200 initial samples for uncertainty sampling) are not encoded.
# - All accuracy results (MAE per uncertainty-sampling iteration, Fig. 5; maximum errors and variances, Figs. S9-S10) are figure-only. Porphyrin targets are excitation energies, not a potential energy surface.
